 separately installed 'standard-sunau'.\r\n  import sunau\r\nok\r\ntest_rejected_periodicity_is_not_gap_filled (test_pitch.PitchTests.test_rejected_periodicity_is_not_gap_filled) ... ok\r\n\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nRan 5 tests in 3.854s\r\n\r\nOK\r\n", "exitCode": 0, "durationMs": 4706}}
